  "hints": [
    "Write a = 2n with a let step.",
    "4n² + 8n + 5 = 4n² + 8n + 4 + 1."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Suppose $a$ is even, so $a = 2n$ for some integer $n$.",
    "Then $a^2 + 4a + 5 = 4n^2 + 8n + 5 = 2(2n^2 + 4n + 2) + 1$, which is odd. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
  "reference": {
    "book": "hammack-bop3",
